Short:        Converts fd-files to assembler-includes
Author:       Hanns Holger Rutz Uploaded-to: ftp.luth.se (03.09.93)
Uploader:     Daniel Amor <amor student uni-tuebingen de>
Type:         util/misc
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

fd2AsmInc       This little program creates assembler-includefiles  from .fd-
                files (I. E. the original Commodore .fd-files).  Features se-
                veral  ways  to format  the output-file.  Bugs fixed  in this
                version  1.0b,  an  update  to  version  1.0a  on  disk  802.
                OS 2.04+, freeware, includes source in assembly.
                Author:  Hanns Holger Rutz
